  "The whole world is subject to Austria"


ACTION REPORT    

Here's what happened to Your Majesty this turn:


  Agesilao treated with his ally Bradipo I (#2).  Agesilao treated with his 
ally Cosmic Herderer Mugai (#3).  Agesilao treated with his ally Prometeo 
(#5).  Agesilao treated with his ally II Kahn (#6).  Agesilao treated with 
his ally Giovanna d'Arco (#7).
  In spring, Mare Frigidis was hit by a plague.  The plague struck the 36th 
Skeletal Garrison in Mare Frigidis and destroyed them.  Agesilao prepared 
his armies to defend Bizerte and the surrounding provinces.
  In early summer, Agesilao, responsible for the defense of Bizerte, learned 
of an enemy attack on Jadegate.  Agesilao marched into Jadegate from Bizerte 
to defend Jadegate against its would-be conquerors.  Agesilao found a Tomb 
(#121) in Jadegate, inhabited by the Basilisk.  Legend says the Large Hoard 
of Gold is hidden here.  The Basilisk is a strong, 8-legged reptilian 
monster with the power to turn a man to stone with its baleful glare.

  Lord Babba Sissoko Master orango (#0) sent an invasion force into the 
Mountain province of Jadegate, owned by Agesilao.  Alain (#33) was in 
command of the invading armies.  The defenders were commanded by Agesilao.  
The armies were drawn up into lines of battle as shown here:

